; ULTIMA UDATA: labels used only in UDATA.ASM. Scope ultima. (worker bu)
L00A0 PspSpareA0         ; PSP command tail; alias of the library's X01A9 (ULTIMA has no such table)
L00A4 PspSpareA4         ; alias of X01AD
L00A8 PspSpareA8         ; alias of X01B1
L00AC PspSpareAC         ; alias of X01B5
